%% F4.6 Pull transfer (HttpData-PULL) in stock EDC 0.14.1; no measured values
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant APP as Consumer application
  participant CCP as Consumer CP
  participant PCP as Provider CP
  participant PDP as Provider DP
  participant SRC as Data source
  Note over APP,PCP: Once per contract (catalogue and negotiation as in push)
  APP->>CCP: transfer request (HttpData-PULL)
  CCP->>PCP: DSP transfer request
  PCP->>PDP: data plane signalling: start
  PDP-->>PCP: endpoint and access token (EDR)
  PCP-->>CCP: DSP transfer start (EDR)
  APP->>CCP: get EDR
  CCP-->>APP: endpoint and token
  loop Every fetch, until the transfer ends
    APP->>PDP: GET endpoint (token)
    PDP->>PDP: check token
    PDP->>SRC: GET data
    SRC-->>PDP: payload
    PDP-->>APP: payload
  end
  Note over PCP,PDP: Policy monitor in the provider CP (about once per second): on expiry or termination, signal the DP to terminate, and later fetches are denied
